1. Create a oauth project with 3 modules:
        + <module>authorization-server</module>
                  <module>client-application</module>
                  <module>resource-server</module>
        + crate 3 module
2. create authorization-server project
    + dependencies: starter authori-server / starter-security/ starter-security-test
    + config : application.yaml / spring.security.oauth2.issuer
    + port : 9000
    + config : registeredClientRepository[clientId/clientSecret/authenticateMode/authorizationGrantType/scope??]
    / securityFilterChain[http.DefaultFormlogin] beans
3. Create resource server module
    + dependencies: starter-resource-server/ starter-web/ starter-security/ starter-security-test
    + config application.yaml : spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.[jwt/opaque]/issuer-uri
    + config securityFilterChain[authorizeHttpRequests/oauth2ResourceServer]
    + /lessons Controller
    + port 8081

4. Create client module
    + dependencies: starter-oauth2-client/ starter-web
    + Config : RestClientConfig[requestInterceptor-oauthManager]/ securityFilterChain[permitAll/ disable-csrf]
    + Controller : lesson -> call lessons(resource-server)[clientRegistrationId]
    + Config: spring.oauth2.client.registration[client(client-id, client-secrect/authorization-grant-type)/provider]

5. Testing
5.1 - get opaque token:
    curl -X POST http://localhost:9000/oauth2/token \
    -u golf-client:golf-secret \
    -H "Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded" \
    -d "grant_type=client_credentials&scope=read"
